pack internal-run8-binding
generation control-1
provenance direct census of .bonfyre/run8/state.sqlite3 on 2026-08-26
authority measured
note This pack binds existing Run8 state into the Internal root product. It does not copy, regenerate or re-schema that state. Counts below are a census timestamp, not a ledger. Provenance stays with the original tables so occurrences keep their identity.

binding internal:run8
  namespace bonfyre/internal/run8
  state_source .bonfyre/run8/state.sqlite3
  binding_kind reference
  regeneration forbidden
  detail Run8 is the native operating system for building Bonfyre with Bonfyre. It does not end after setup and it is not migrated into a new schema for the sake of the root topology.

table_binding internal:run8/work
  namespace bonfyre/internal/run8/work
  table work_items
  census_count 136
table_binding internal:run8/proof
  namespace bonfyre/internal/run8/proof
  table anti_amnesia
  census_count 507
  detail Proof frontier, solved invariants, known non-causes, regression fences and failure fingerprints.
table_binding internal:run8/epochs
  namespace bonfyre/internal/run8/epochs
  table epochs
  census_count 192
table_binding internal:run8/receipts
  namespace bonfyre/internal/run8/receipts
  table receipts
  census_count 192
  carrier_split claude 125
  carrier_split codex 67
table_binding internal:run8/providers
  namespace bonfyre/internal/run8/providers
  table provider_state
  census_count 2
table_binding internal:run8/mesh
  namespace bonfyre/internal/run8/mesh
  table mesh_events
  census_count 118
  table mesh_delivery
  delivery_count 112
  table mesh_export_state
  table mesh_quarantine
table_binding internal:run8/scheduler
  namespace bonfyre/internal/run8/scheduler
  table scheduler_history
  census_count 192

filesystem_binding internal:run8/artifacts
  path .bonfyre/run8/canonical
  path .bonfyre/run8/checkpoints
  path .bonfyre/run8/convergence
  path .bonfyre/run8/epochs
  path .bonfyre/run8/evidence
  path .bonfyre/run8/mesh
  path .bonfyre/run8/partner
  path .bonfyre/run8/receipts
  binding_kind reference

related_pack packs/run-history
related_pack packs/system-upgrades
related_pack packs/fpq-proof-frontier

invariant Run8 state is bound by reference; a rebuild of the root topology never rewrites it
invariant the operator lock and heartbeat are live operational state and are not treated as durable evidence
forbidden_inference a census count in this pack -> the current row count
